This repository includes no dataset files. The back-test uses the TAWOS
dataset, obtained separately from its original source and subject to the
TAWOS terms of use (https://github.com/SOLAR-group/TAWOS):
Tawosi, Al-Subaihin, Moussa and Sarro, "A Versatile Dataset of Agile Open
Source Software Projects", MSR 2022. https://doi.org/10.1145/3524842.3528029
Tawosi, Moussa and Sarro, "On the Relationship Between Story Points and
Development Effort in Agile Open-Source Software", ESEM 2022.
https://doi.org/10.1145/3544902.3546238
